exy\" (poor but sexy), as a former mayor would have it, Berlin attracts young people, students, and a creative bohème like few other cities in the world. With architectural heritage from Prussian monarchism, Nazism, East German communism and Potsdamer Platz, filled with 1990s- and 2000s-style glass palaces after having been a \"blank canvas\" due to the wall, Berlin's architecture is as varied as its neighbourhoods and its people.","grounding":[{"source":"wikivoyage","title":"Berlin","url":"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Berlin","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"short":"Berlin is a sprawling, unpolished capital in Germany where history sits in the open. The Brandenburg Gate, Reichstag Building and Museum Island are the first round, and the sights run to about 17 hours. May to September is the season.","short_src":"rewrite","facts":{"population":3426354,"visit_h":13.6}},"highlights":[{"id":"hl-brandenburg-gate","name":"Brandenburg Gate","kind":"Monument","lat":52.51627,"lon":13.37772,"dist_km":1.8,"rank_score":11.33,"resolved_by":"catalogue"},{"id":"hl-pergamon-museum","name":"Pergamon Museum","kind":"Museum","lat":52.521,"lon":13.396,"dist_km":0.6,"rank_score":10.79,"resolved_by":"catalogue","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Pergamonmuseum_Front.jpg/960px-Pergamonmuseum_Front.jpg","author":"Raimond Spekking","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licence_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pergamonmuseum_Front.jpg","w":1024,"h":611,"ok_print":true}},{"id":"hl-congress-of-berlin","name":"congress of Berlin","kind":"Peak","lat":52.51167,"lon":13.38194,"dist_km":1.7,"rank_score":10.76,"resolved_by":"catalogue"},{"id":"hl-museum-island","name":"Museum Island","kind":"Old town","lat":52.52139,"lon":13.39556,"dist_km":0.6,"rank_score":10.71,"resolved_by":"catalogue","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/Berlin_Museumsinsel_Fernsehturm.jpg/960px-Berlin